358        * Average Marginal Effects (Model 4, logit link): AME = E[p(1-p) * beta_i];
359        * where p = logistic(X*beta) is the mean of BMIPCT/100.;
360        data coef4;
361        	set genmod_results_4;
362        	length ParmName $32 EffectName $50;
363        	ParmName = coalescec(Parm, Parameter);
364        	if missing(Level1) then EffectName = ParmName;
365        	else EffectName = catx('_', ParmName, Level1);
366        run;

